# Unicode CLDR 47, locale hy, gregorian calendar (cldr-json
# cldr-dates-full/main/hy/ca-gregorian.json).
# The wide name շաբաթ is also the ordinary noun "week", and nothing in the
# surface distinguishes the two readings, so only the phrase that names the
# day unambiguously is claimed here: en.wiktionary.org, շաբաթ ("շաբաթ օրը --
# on Saturday").  A bare շաբաթ reads as the week unit.
շաբաթ օրը
շաբաթ օր
